  "content": "<p align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oPVtrP5.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n\n<center><a style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ?color=885425&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/izofar/wither-waltz\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/plays-3.8k-55302b?logo=soundcloud&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/izofar43\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/followers-35-885425?logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/izofar/bygone-nether\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/izofar/bygone-nether?color=55302b&amp;label=license&amp;logo=github&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether/files\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.3.2-885425?label=Version&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a></center>\n</br>\n\n## 📖 關於：\n\n> *一款旨在提升地獄維度 lore，並在生存模式中提供額外挑戰與引人入 gameplay 的 Minecraft 1.16.5+ 地獄結構模組。*\n\n探索每個地獄生物群落獨有的新結構，以及居住其中的新怪獸。要塞的重新設計與地獄玄武岩中的堡壘殘跡均已實現。詳見圖片標籤以獲得預覽！\n\n在 [SoundCloud](https://soundcloud.com/izofar) 上聆聽原聲帶。這是我的首個發布模組，請關注我的其他作品，並期待更多更新！**考慮在下方支持我，這將使我有更多時間進行更新和修復。**\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## 🎥 影片：\n\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0XQCWCl2FaA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n</br>\n\n<center><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JaPvLVb5JwQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></center>\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## 依賴項：\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/9tshDxW.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/pKf97it.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.20.1.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/b1sKEDp.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/NFDhQUd.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.19.2.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/ek7ODYh.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZVo2Y5w.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.18.2.html)\n* <img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmJfA0d.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\" />[<img src=\"https://imgur.com/LK6Yi7Q.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\" />](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.16.5.html)\n* 無需其他模組依賴！\n\n<img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\" />\n\n## 🍳 配方：\n<details>\n<summary>預覽內容</summary>\n\n### 鍍金下界鋼（鐵砧）：\n<center><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wFyJnPJ.png\"></center>\n\n### 凋靈（在地面放置方塊時生成）：\n<center><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hsTLmMd.png\"></center>\n</details>\n\n## 📦 與其他模組的整合功能：\n\n請參閱 [CurseForge 上的 Bygone Nether 頁面](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether) 以查看完整的整合列表！\n\n## ✔️ 舊問題修復：\n> tldr：請更新至最新版的 Bygone Nether 和 Forge！\n\n請參閱 [CurseForge 上的 Bygone Nether 頁面](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether) 以查看詳細的修復建議清單！\n\n## 鳴謝：\n\n特別感謝 Mod Development Discord 社區中的 Telepathic Grunt、Sizable Shrimp、Commoble 和 Cadiboo，在開發過程中提供的協助與指導。",
